@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@orderNumber = {{order.response.body.$.data.orderNumber}}
@amount = {{order.response.body.$.data.totalAmount}}

### 0. 로그인
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@shoplab.com", "password": "Test1234!" }

### 1. 주문 생성 (결제 대기)
# @name order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }],
  "recipient": "홍길동", "phone": "010-1234-5678", "zipcode": "06236", "address1": "서울시"
}

### 2. 금액 위변조 → 400 AMOUNT_MISMATCH (토스 호출 전에 막힘)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentKey": "fake-payment-key", "orderId": "{{orderNumber}}", "amount": 100 }

### 3. 가짜 paymentKey + 정상 금액 → 토스가 거절 → 400 PAYMENT_FAILED (토스의 메시지)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentKey": "fake-payment-key", "orderId": "{{orderNumber}}", "amount": {{amount}} }

### 4. 결제 전 주문 취소 → 200 CANCELED (토스 호출 없이 재고만 복구)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderNumber}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 주문 상세 (1번에서 만든 주문)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 상품 재고 확인 (1번에서 주문한 상품 id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1